i/File:Shivalik_College_Dehradun,_Uttarakhand.jpg", "descriptionshorturl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=102690014", "extmetadata": {"DateTime": {"value": "2021-03-31 06:29:18", "source": "mediawiki-metadata", "hidden": ""}, "ObjectName": {"value": "Shivalik College Dehradun, Uttarakhand", "source": "mediawiki-metadata"}, "CommonsMetadataExtension": {"value": 1.2, "source": "extension", "hidden": ""}, "Categories": {"value": "Engineering colleges in Uttarakhand|People of Dehradun|Self-published work|Education buildings in Dehradun", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "Assessments": {"value": "", "source": "commons-categories", "hidden": ""}, "ImageDescription": {"value": "Shivalik College Dehradun, Uttarakhand is affiliated with Uttarakhand Technical University for Under-Graduate Engineering programs and Uttarakhand Board of Technical Education Roorkee (U.B.T.E.R.) for Polytechnic (Diploma in Engineering) programs. The college strives to equip students with exceptional academic and professional skills, and groom them in accordance with future employability, and social responsibility. It is a hub for intelligence, creativity, diversity, innovation, and humanity to come together and produce an exemplary concoction of integrity and merit. We keep our students challenged, encouraged, engaged, and keen. We let them grow into their skins, and embrace confidence, grit, and individuality.\n<p>URL - <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.shivalikcollege.edu.in/college-of-engineering\">https://www.shivalikcollege.edu.in/college-of-engineering</a>\n</p>\nWebsite - <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.shivalikcollege.edu.in/\">https://www.shivalikcollege.edu.in/</a>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "DateTimeOriginal": {"value": "2018-03-03 17:25:12", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Credit": {"value": "<span class=\"int-own-work\" lang=\"en\">Own work</span>", "source": "commons-desc-page"}, "Arti